ng in the tiller pilot?"},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2016-10-07 13:25:09","text":"Yup, our friend's first attempt at using it.  It worked fairly well."},{"author":"94951113@N04","date":"2016-10-08 08:52:52","text":"[https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering] Yeah, we have one; it's not very powerful so only ok as long as the sea is flat but a godsend if we have to motor any distance.  We call him Harry, after the Third Man."},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2016-10-08 22:29:10","text":"On the trip I did to Alaska a couple of years ago, the captain called his auto pilot \"Little Susie\".  As in:\n\n\"Wake up, little Susie, wake up\nWake up, little Susie, wake up\n\nWe've both been sound asleep\nWake up little Susie and weep\nThe movie's over, it's four o'clock\nAnd we're in trouble deep\"\n\nAnyway, you get the idea.  Not reliable.\n\nPics from Alaska sail.  Man, that was fun: www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/sets/72157644544117620"}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0116.json","filename":"30057220782_a14d72bb8e_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/30057220782/","height":5324,"id":"30057220782","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/30057220782/30057220782_a14d72bb8e_o.jpg","sha256":"4a0ce70d335210d28eafc69b2f54542840fc51ae7bc04e5a86fe9129aa21f2bf","tags":["seattle","sailing"],"taken":"2016-09-08 15:44:33","title":"IMG_2252","uploaded":"2016-10-07 07:46:33","width":3550},"30057220986":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":6810}],"bytes":3127216,"camera_position":6810,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0116.json","filename":"30057220986_4db0d48f4a_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/30057220986/","height":3091,"id":"30057220986","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/30057220986/30057220986_4db0d48f4a_o.jpg","sha256":"e4fb52b03227eba7684745c2c1153571ead6afb345793aa96d58218117e329c1","tags":["port townsend","pt",